This native DSH adapter is maintained by the flyingcoding/dsh-magic-context fork.

Audited source reuse from cortexkit/magic-context (MIT), baseline
6f718ff019bf327a0b291a8510dfb42f91b65921:

- packages/plugin/src/shared/sqlite.ts: runtime-selected SQLite backend,
  savepoint-aware transactions, connection accounting, and argument binding.
- packages/plugin/src/features/magic-context/memory/normalize-hash.ts:
  whitespace and case normalization for keyword search. DSH write deduplication
  preserves case-sensitive identifiers and configuration values.
- packages/plugin/src/features/magic-context/memory/types.ts: type-only category vocabulary.

The runtime bundle contains those source leaves. No compiled community port,
upstream compaction engine, embedding model, UI runtime, or auxiliary agent is
used by the native Host memory path. DSH Client code is a separate browser artifact.

Upstream MIT notices are retained in LICENSE. The upstream OpenCode and Pi
package names and release processes are unchanged.
